{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6.323698019073486\">00:06</span> ### 1-1 Hetuduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-37-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-37a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12.621936942779541\">00:12</span> 1. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37b-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"38.540890856948856\">00:38</span> 2. Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"61.96414488937378\">01:01</span> 3. Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37b-3</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"96.67804784169006\">01:36</span> 4. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37b-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"103.29607010299682\">01:43</span> 5. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte nava, āsevane nava, kamme nava, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne nava, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37b-5</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"136.2264990257492\">02:16</span> 6. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti naadhipatipaccayā. (3) ^7-37b-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"161.17679133473968\">02:41</span> 7. Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-37b-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"171.02692797997284\">02:51</span> Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Napurejātapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"181.7382706881485\">03:01</span> 8. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati napurejātapaccayā… nava… napacchājātapaccayā… nava… naāsevanapaccayā … nava. ^7-37b-8</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nakammapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"197.45899298283385\">03:17</span> 9. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1) ^7-37b-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"208.20227597138978\">03:28</span> Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"215.93614502861024\">03:35</span> Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Navipākapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"230.50822906294252\">03:50</span> 10. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu kusalo dhammo uppajjati navipākapaccayā… nava…pe… navippayuttapaccayā… nava. ^7-37b-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"242.8033587997284\">04:02</span> 11. Naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37b-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"257.86899095708463\">04:17</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anuloma paccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"260.76090379686735\">04:20</span> Naadhipatipaccayā hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi paccayavārampi nissayavārampi saṃsaṭṭhavārampi sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"279.8067001788139\">04:39</span> 12. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa ca nahetussa kusalassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37c-12</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"305.1820089475479\">05:05</span> 13. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37c-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"313.54390692609024\">05:13</span> Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"322.5298818831749\">05:22</span> Hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā hetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"332.3883141168251\">05:32</span> 14. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi. ^7-37c-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"343.94603689986417\">05:43</span> Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"355.33578021219256\">05:55</span> Hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā hetussa kusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Anantarapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"367.2630118569489\">06:07</span> 15. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… samanantarapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… aññamaññapaccayena paccayo… nissayapaccayena paccayo. ^7-37c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"382.85199402861025\">06:22</span> 16. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo… tīṇi. ^7-37c-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"401.1240771811981\">06:41</span> Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"416.0874589847412\">06:56</span> Hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā hetussa kusalassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo… tīṇi, āsevanapaccayena paccayo… nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"435.83451890234375\">07:15</span> 17. Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa ca nahetussa kusalassa ca dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37c-17</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Āhārapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"464.95811209460453\">07:44</span> 18. Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa āhārapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37c-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"473.7104757924805\">07:53</span> 19. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa indriyapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37c-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"482.634682100708\">08:02</span> 20. Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa jhānapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37c-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"491.13716396643065\">08:11</span> 21. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa maggapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37c-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"498.3757390823975\">08:18</span> 22. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava. ^7-37c-22</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"527.6779280213623\">08:47</span> 23. Hetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37c-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"545.3433227222899\">09:05</span> 24. Nahetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu kusalo dhammo hetussa kusalassa ca nahetussa kusalassa ca dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37c-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"581.5786712990722\">09:41</span> 25. Hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā hetussa kusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (3) ^7-37c-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"596.4132659023437\">09:56</span> 26. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… noavigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37c-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"604.4352179633789\">10:04</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"612.1203141739502\">10:12</span>  Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-37d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"631.1054699969483\">10:31</span> 27. Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37e-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"659.1389229237061\">10:59</span> 28. Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37e-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"684.6052300793457\">11:24</span> 29. Hetuṃ akusalañca nahetuṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ akusalañca nahetuṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ akusalañca nahetuṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37e-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"719.2665453509522\">11:59</span> 30. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… kamme nava, āhāre nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomaṃ). ^7-37e-30</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"728.6819628443603\">12:08</span> 31. Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-37e-31</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"735.5840332074241\">12:15</span> 32. Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā… nava…pe…. ^7-37e-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"744.21058810252\">12:24</span> Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"751.7675049213219\">12:31</span> Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"759.6356288879433\">12:39</span> Hetuṃ akusalañca nahetuṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu akusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"769.5905507925759\">12:49</span> 33. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37e-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"785.047867988079\">13:05</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"788.5333849451637\">13:08</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi paccayavārampi nissayavārampi saṃsaṭṭhavārampi sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"805.7423701311302\">13:25</span> 34. Hetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa ca nahetussa akusalassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37f-34</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"832.6534057739792\">13:52</span> 35. Hetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37f-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"841.9090509599457\">14:01</span> Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"851.1477270829697\">14:11</span> Hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā hetussa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"860.8136338197555\">14:20</span> 36. Hetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi. ^7-37f-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"871.1337648311996\">14:31</span> Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"883.4145037825623\">14:43</span> Hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā hetussa akusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"895.932663994278\">14:55</span> 37. Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa ca nahetussa akusalassa ca dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37f-37</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Āhārapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"925.8859719904633\">15:25</span> 38. Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa āhārapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37f-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"935.2852800171661\">15:35</span> 39. Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa indriyapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37f-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"942.9277781261711\">15:42</span> 40. Nahetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa akusalassa dhammassa jhānapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37f-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"951.3951979922753\">15:51</span> 41. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava. ^7-37f-41</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"981.803784997425\">16:21</span> 42. Hetu akusalo dhammo hetussa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37f-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"995.403824193119\">16:35</span> 43. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava, naadhipatiyā nava, naanantare nava, nasamanantare nava, nasahajāte nava, naaññamaññe nava…pe… noavigate nava (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37f-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1011.5791009794006\">16:51</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1014.9522010463486\">16:54</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1018.5814448274803\">16:58</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-37g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1032.3952652034186\">17:12</span> 44. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu abyākato ca nahetu abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37h-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1059.4871822394675\">17:39</span> 45. Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-37h-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1069.2043678815537\">17:49</span> Hetuṃ abyākatañca nahetuṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1080.9025080000001\">18:00</span> 46. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37h-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1092.8950200540735\">18:12</span> 47. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte nava, āsevane nava, kamme nava, vipāke nava, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne nava, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37h-47</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1128.7333228226166\">18:48</span> 48. Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-37h-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1139.5049511716613\">18:59</span> 49. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-37h-49</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1147.807567228882\">19:07</span> Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1157.2830079542236\">19:17</span> Hetuṃ abyākatañca nahetuṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1168.3338069628066\">19:28</span> 50. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā… nava…pe…. ^7-37h-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1177.929280753952\">19:37</span> 51. Hetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1) ^7-37h-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1185.633757128746\">19:45</span> Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1193.8240812918243\">19:53</span> Hetuṃ abyākatañca nahetuṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1205.3435107825624\">20:05</span> 52. Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu abyākato dhammo uppajjati naāhārapaccayā… naindriyapaccayā… najhānapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37h-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1217.677737991417\">20:17</span> 53. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, naanantare tīṇi, nasamanantare tīṇi, naaññamaññe tīṇi, naupanissaye tīṇi, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte nava, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37h-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1258.1138640915528\">20:58</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1263.770442736786\">21:03</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1267.7145490972748\">21:07</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1280.9908799256134\">21:20</span> 54. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa ca nahetussa abyākatassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37i-54</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1308.4723618311996\">21:48</span> 55. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37i-55</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1317.5770460801086\">21:57</span> 56. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi. ^7-37i-56</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1329.7538469113083\">22:09</span> Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1342.2340331716614\">22:22</span> Hetu abyākato ca nahetu abyākato ca dhammā hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Purejātapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1355.4403347081757\">22:35</span> 57. Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa purejātapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37i-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1364.8846563118516\">22:44</span> 58. Hetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa pacchājātapaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-37i-58</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1378.1755199370575\">22:58</span> Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa pacchājātapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1386.2846242202988\">23:06</span> Hetu abyākato ca nahetu abyākato ca dhammā nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa pacchājātapaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1396.40893825177\">23:16</span> 59. Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37i-59</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1405.5132151430512\">23:25</span> 60. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa vipākapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37i-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1414.137584120163\">23:34</span> 61. Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo… jhānapaccayena paccayo… maggapaccayena paccayo… sampayuttapaccayena paccayo. ^7-37i-61</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Vippayuttapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1433.199438268936\">23:53</span> 62. Hetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa vippayuttapaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-37i-62</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1440.9796939685286\">24:00</span> Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa vippayuttapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1450.8087278226167\">24:10</span> Hetu abyākato ca nahetu abyākato ca dhammā nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa vippayuttapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1460.8314978569488\">24:20</span> 63. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte tīṇi, pacchājāte tīṇi, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava. ^7-37i-63</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1496.7517698254776\">24:56</span> 64. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Hetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… pacchājātapaccayena paccayo. Hetu abyākato dhammo hetussa abyākatassa ca nahetussa abyākatassa ca dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37i-64</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1540.7905420457764\">25:40</span> 65. Nahetu abyākato dhammo nahetussa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… purejātapaccayena paccayo… pacchājātapaccayena paccayo… āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo. ^7-37i-65</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1557.8121852231598\">25:57</span> 66. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava, naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37i-66</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1563.4963083089906\">26:03</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1570.1378171516342\">26:10</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1585.6498600991822\">26:25</span> Hetudukakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1590.963948032425\">26:30</span> #### 1-2. Hetuduka-vedanāttikaṃ ^7-37j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Sukhāyavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-37k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1599.963322082016\">26:39</span> 67. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37l-67</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1638.1843052755166\">27:18</span> 68. Nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37l-68</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1677.052056020027\">27:57</span> 69. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-37l-69</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1729.525058810791\">28:49</span> 70. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte nava, āsevane nava, kamme nava, vipāke nava, āhāre nava…pe… avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37l-70</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1752.690642\">29:12</span> 71. Nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-37l-71</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1767.4123168413087\">29:27</span> 72. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37l-72</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1791.2887280671387\">29:51</span> 73. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte nava (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37l-73</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1808.2984211434325\">30:08</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1823.6491568450278\">30:23</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1837.0279250047683\">30:37</span> 74. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37m-74</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1848.7130339141693\">30:48</span> 75. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37m-75</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1861.5607360658034\">31:01</span> Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1874.4962489370575\">31:14</span> Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1890.3804000429154\">31:30</span> 76. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi. ^7-37m-76</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1905.4967143318786\">31:45</span> Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1920.9656472460479\">32:00</span> Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Upanissayapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1938.6035971544952\">32:18</span> 77. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo… nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37m-77</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1960.36537625177\">32:40</span> 78. Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa ca nahetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa ca dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37m-78</p><p><br /></p><p>…Vipākapaccayena paccayo.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2001.0373150514984\">33:21</span> 79. Nahetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa āhārapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi…pe…. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa avigatapaccayena paccayo. ^7-37m-79</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2024.0199960600814\">33:44</span> 80. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava. ^7-37m-80</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2058.226646114441\">34:18</span> 81. Hetu sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37m-81</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2073.4746280629424\">34:33</span> 82. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava…pe… noavigate nava (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37m-82</p><p><br /></p><p>Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2087.229056828339\">34:47</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Dukkhāyavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-37n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2100.053328268936\">35:00</span> 83. Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37o-83</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2141.929946988556\">35:41</span> Nahetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2153.690793822617\">35:53</span> Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2171.781381977112\">36:11</span> 84. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte nava, āsevane nava, kamme nava, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne nava, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37o-84</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2208.27935322316\">36:48</span> 85. Nahetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (1) ^7-37o-85</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2219.2368630715255\">36:59</span> 86. Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37o-86</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2230.8287650314714\">37:10</span> 87. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ (paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37o-87</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2246.140562011444\">37:26</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2249.920889894142\">37:29</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2254.1366088340606\">37:34</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37p-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2266.710260240326\">37:46</span> 88. Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa ca nahetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-37p-88</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2307.8780177768404\">38:27</span> 89. Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37p-89</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2320.506410894142\">38:40</span> Nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2332.7595049828337\">38:52</span> Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā hetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2349.9048080543594\">39:09</span> 90. Nahetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37p-90</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2362.9237166824264\">39:22</span> 91. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37p-91</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2393.2492168369217\">39:53</span> 92. Hetu dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37p-92</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2412.7050009542236\">40:12</span> 93. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava, naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37p-93</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2418.818182123024\">40:18</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2425.723681234604\">40:25</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Adukkhamasukhāyavedanāyasampayuttapadaṃ ^7-37q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37r-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2438.404611874115\">40:38</span> 94. Hetuṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-37r-94</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2455.5557231344683\">40:55</span> Nahetuṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2469.5848632031325\">41:09</span> Hetuṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2488.4729397940064\">41:28<