utto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37s-99</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2613.667303326157\">43:33</span> 100. Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37s-100</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2626.9214660543594\">43:46</span> 101. Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi. ^7-37s-101</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2643.7489411459123\">44:03</span> Nahetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2661.457397736786\">44:21</span> Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca nahetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto ca dhammā hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi (ārammaṇādhipatiyeva)…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Upanissayapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2684.62208888842\">44:44</span>  102. Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇūpanissayo, anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo… nava, āsevanapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37s-102</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2706.45814674823\">45:06</span> 103. Nahetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo nahetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa kammapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37s-103</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2723.1004122861023\">45:23</span> 104. Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa vipākapaccayena paccayo… nava…pe… avigatapaccayena paccayo… nava. ^7-37s-104</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2746.153320203133\">45:46</span> 105. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (anulomaṃ). ^7-37s-105</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2771.326516997139\">46:11</span> 106. Hetu adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo hetussa adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37s-106</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2790.286202862671\">46:30</span> 107. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37s-107</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2794.4495639685288\">46:34</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2798.1346888912813\">46:38</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2801.36248488842\">46:41</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2816.9922470801084\">46:56</span> Hetudukavedanāttikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2824.8449509399184\">47:04</span> #### 1-3. Hetuduka-vipākattikaṃ ^7-37t-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Vipākapadaṃ ^7-37u-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37v-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2828.301889968529\">47:08</span> 108. Hetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu vipāko ca nahetu vipāko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-37v-108</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2854.550793868393\">47:34</span> Nahetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2862.8887868140337\">47:42</span> Hetuṃ vipākañca nahetuṃ vipākañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2872.611554988556\">47:52</span> 109. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte nava, kamme nava, vipāke nava, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne nava, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte nava atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava. (Anulomaṃ). ^7-37v-109</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2903.2173673290176\">48:23</span> 110. Nahetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-37v-110</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2911.8694619113085\">48:31</span> 111. Hetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu vipāko dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37v-111</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2919.769687879837\">48:39</span> 112. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-37v-112</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2936.3789571001357\">48:56</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomapaccanīyaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2940.2838843118516\">49:00</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyānulomaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2944.1281421716612\">49:04</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37w-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2957.7786093175737\">49:17</span> 113. Hetu vipāko dhammo hetussa vipākassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37w-113</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2969.135677102997\">49:29</span> 114. Hetu vipāko dhammo hetussa vipākassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37w-114</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2976.508021160217\">49:36</span> Nahetu vipāko dhammo nahetussa vipākassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2985.409149291824\">49:45</span> Hetu vipāko ca nahetu vipāko ca dhammā hetussa vipākassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (tadārammaṇāyeva labbhanti).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2995.5342660658034\">49:55</span> 115. Hetu vipāko dhammo hetussa vipākassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (sahajātādhipatiyeva labbhati, ārammaṇādhipati natthi)…pe…. ^7-37w-115</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Upanissayapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3007.2165662031325\">50:07</span> 116. Hetu vipāko dhammo hetussa vipākassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo – anantarūpanissayo, pakatūpanissayo. Hetu vipāko dhammo nahetussa vipākassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena pacc