><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4857.293081788284\">1:20:57</span> Nahetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4873.962602211715\">1:21:13</span> Hetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikañca nahetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4889.579416266075\">1:21:29</span> 187. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… kamme nava, āhāre nava, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37-187</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4898.147953197411\">1:21:38</span> 188. Nahetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. ^7-37-188</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4909.497222922752\">1:21:49</span> Hetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4920.97170697139\">1:22:00</span> 189. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37-189</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4933.252059197411\">1:22:13</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4944.346762120163\">1:22:24</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4960.225139\">1:22:40</span> 190. Hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo hetussa saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37-190</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4972.53853991703\">1:22:52</span> Hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo hetussa saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4984.272795174523\">1:23:04</span> Hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo hetussa saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4997.849372208855\">1:23:17</span> 191. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37-191</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5027.544735246048\">1:23:47</span> 192. Hetu saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo hetussa saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37-192</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5044.543513991417\">1:24:04</span> 193. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37-193</p><p><br /></p><p>Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5057.226877908447\">1:24:17</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikapadaṃ ^7-37-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37-0</p><p><br /></