\">2:34:29</span> Nahetu sekkho dhammo nahetussa sekkhassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9280.136826753953\">2:34:40</span> Hetu sekkho dhammo hetussa sekkhassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9287.861364117301\">2:34:47</span> 335. Hetuyā tīṇi, adhipatiyā cha, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ç-335</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9314.155388979972\">2:35:14</span> 336. Hetu sekkho dhammo hetussa sekkhassa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo, upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ç-336</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9325.468516125886\">2:35:25</span> 337. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ç-337</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9329.124782068664\">2:35:29</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9332.372813759674\">2:35:32</span> Nahetupaccayā adhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9335.913502985695\">2:35:35</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi naṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Asekkhapadaṃ ^7-37È-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37É-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9350.70443705722\">2:35:50</span> 338. Hetuṃ asekkhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu asekkho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-37É-338<