. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… āsevane nava, kamme nava, āhāre nava, indriye nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37û-462</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Naadhipatipaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12786.543058097275\">3:33:06</span> 463. Hetuṃ maggahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu maggahetuko dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37û-463</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12795.33259194564\">3:33:15</span> 464. Naadhipatiyā cha, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37û-464</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12806.63861402575\">3:33:26</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā cha (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>Naadhipatipaccayā hetuyā cha (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12813.132971062943\">3:33:33</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37ü-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-adhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12827.837444939918\">3:33:47</span> 465. Hetu maggahetuko dhammo hetussa maggahetukassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37ü-465</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12838.086793708175\">3:33:58</span> Hetu maggahetuko dhammo hetussa maggahetukassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12848.807460008584\">3:34:08</span> Nahetu maggahetuko dhammo nahetussa maggahetukassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12860.411784848366\">3:34:20</span> 466. Hetuyā tīṇi, adhipatiyā cha, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, kamm