bbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37ĝ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14917.985669174523\">4:08:37</span> 537. Hetu bahiddhārammaṇo dhammo hetussa bahiddhārammaṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37ĝ-537</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14930.354278988556\">4:08:50</span> Hetu bahiddhārammaṇo dhammo hetussa bahiddhārammaṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14940.590546825477\">4:09:00</span> Hetu bahiddhārammaṇo dhammo hetussa bahiddhārammaṇassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14951.955692839783\">4:09:11</span> Nahetu bahiddhārammaṇo dhammo nahetussa bahiddhārammaṇassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – sahajātādhipati… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14963.43679380259\">4:09:23</span> 538. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā cha, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37ĝ-538</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14974.076200048637\">4:09:34</span> 539. Hetu bahiddhārammaṇo dhammo hetussa bahiddhārammaṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37ĝ-539</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14986.796452185967\">4:09:46</span> 540. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37ĝ-540</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14990.885477040054\">4:09:50</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14994.073976040054\">4:09:54</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14997.137647231742\">4:09:57</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Hetudukaajjhattārammaṇattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-22. Hetuduka-sanidassanasappaṭighattikaṃ ^7-37Ğ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Anidassanasappaṭighapadaṃ ^7-37ğ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37Ġ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15035.944615985694\">4:10:35</span> 541. Nahetuṃ anidassanasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu anidassanasappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… adhipatipaccayā… sahajātapaccayā… aññamaññapaccayā … nissayapaccayā… kammapaccayā… vipākapaccayā… āhārapaccayā… indriyapaccayā… jhānapaccayā… maggapaccayā… vippayuttapaccayā… atthipaccayā… avigatapaccayā. ^7-37Ġ-541</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15068.457725205993\">4:11:08</span> 542. Hetuyā ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, magge ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ġ-542</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15087.103824231743\">4:11:27</span> 543. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ (sabbe paccayā kātabbā)…pe… novigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ġ-543</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37ġ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Sahajātapaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15099.264457842644\">4:11:39</span> 544. Nahetu anidassanasappaṭigho dhammo nahetussa anidassanasappaṭighassa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo… aññamaññapaccayena paccayo… nissayapaccayena paccayo… atthipaccayena paccayo… avigatapaccayena paccayo (sabbattha ekaṃ). ^7-37ġ-544</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Anidassanaappaṭighapadaṃ ^7-37Ģ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-37ģ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15119.707081040055\">4:11:59</span> 545. Hetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-37ģ-545</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15135.593829914169\">4:12:15</span> Nahetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15146.479225845505\">4:12:26</span> Hetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighañca nahetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15159.731898899865\">4:12:39</span> 546. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… kamme nava, vipāke nava, āhāre nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37ģ-546</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetu-naadhipatipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15169.399625908447\">4:12:49</span> 547. Nahetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (2) ^7-37ģ-547</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15189.923256979973\">4:13:09</span> Hetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15201.106191951363\">4:13:21</span> Hetuṃ anidassanaappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15211.538448128746\">4:13:31</span> 548. Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte tīṇi, navippayutte nava, nonatthiyā tīṇi, novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37ģ-548</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15238.864857725343\">4:13:58</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15244.15743688842\">4:14:04</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15250.875526822616\">4:14:10</span> (Sahajātavāropi paccayavāropi nissayavāropi saṃsaṭṭhavāropi sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-37Ĥ-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15263.293254137328\">4:14:23</span> 549. Hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo hetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-37Ĥ-549</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15277.61509802575\">4:14:37</span> Hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo hetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15288.246845048638\">4:14:48</span> Hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo hetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati, sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15301.595111125886\">4:15:01</span> Nahetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo nahetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati sahajātādhipati… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15316.268634902724\">4:15:16</span> Hetu anidassanaappaṭigho ca nahetu anidassanaappaṭigho ca dhammā hetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo – ārammaṇādhipati… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15331.731210160217\">4:15:31</span> 550. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe nava, nissaye nava, upanissaye nava, purejāte tīṇi, pacchājāte tīṇi, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, vipāke nava, āhāre tīṇi, indriye nava, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā nava, natthiyā nava, vigate nava, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ĥ-550</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15365.74292185981\">4:16:05</span> 551. Hetu anidassanaappaṭigho dhammo hetussa anidassanaappaṭighassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ĥ-551</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15379.60383472248\">4:16:19</span> 552. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-37Ĥ-552</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15383.628850788284\">4:16:23</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15387.188596205993\">4:16:27</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15390.723191108718\">4:16:30</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Hetudukasanidassanasappaṭighattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":15412.618065}